# chromium powers the Mosaic tab thumbnail capture (metablog-shots.timer,
# #956 — see api/shots.py / common/secubox_core/shotter.py). Recommends, not
# Depends: without it, captures fail gracefully (a site just keeps its emoji
# placeholder) — nothing else in the package needs it. python3-websockets is
# deliberately NOT declared here either, same rationale already documented
# in secubox-core/debian/control (apt's 10.4 breaks uvicorn; the working
# 16.0 comes from pip).
Recommends: chromium
Description: SecuBox MetaBlogizer - Static Site Publisher
 Static site publishing and management for SecuBox.
